# Site chrome

- Match homepage and `/builder/` : max-width ~920px, Dogica pixel fonts, FF7 blue panels, cyan links, starfield.
- Builder load banner: never force `display` in a way that overrides `[hidden]` (empty bordered box bug).
- Homepage builder entry points: **header nav + hero CTA only**. Sections link to GitHub, not more builder buttons.
- Prefer editing existing `index.html` / `builder/builder.css` over new CSS frameworks.
- Do not revive demo packs, sample.bin UI, or PPF flows.
